WEBVTT

00:10:29.692 --> 00:10:33.136
or to share highlights from your totally
boring weekend in quarantine.

00:10:33.160 --> 00:10:36.444
Those superficial strategies
overlook that we bond best

00:10:36.468 --> 00:10:39.676
when our individual actions
contribute to a common purpose.

00:10:40.180 --> 00:10:45.196
Research reveals that it's critical
to establish team goals and clarify roles,

00:10:45.220 --> 00:10:47.346
especially in big teams.

00:10:47.370 --> 00:10:50.756
Having team goals creates
a sense of shared identity.

00:10:50.780 --> 00:10:54.196
Having clear roles prevents
social loafing and free-riding,

00:10:54.220 --> 00:10:57.621
helping people feel that their individual
responsibilities matter.

00:10:58.720 --> 00:11:02.454
The other key challenge of virtual teams
is shared understanding,